Test of quoted-printable encoding.
==================================

This is activated by a content-transfer-encoding of "auto" 
(which may be the default).

A normal line.

A long line which needs to be broken because quoted-printable requires a maximum line length of 76 characters.

A line containing non-ASCII chäráçters which must be encoded. (Here, UTF-8, but same for any non-ASCII charset.)

